---
---
<section class="section section--subtle" id="about" data-num="01">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about__grid" data-reveal>
      <div class="about__content">
        <span class="section__label">About Us</span>
        <h2 class="section__title">Established in 2014,<br/>Building Trust Ever Since</h2>
        <p class="about__text">
          Founded by <strong>Mr. E.A. Malik</strong> in I.P. Extension, New Delhi, ARS Engineers & Technology
          has grown from a small workshop to a trusted name in crushing and conveying solutions.
        </p>
        <p class="about__text">
          As a proprietorship firm with a team of <strong>10+ skilled professionals</strong>, we manufacture
          and supply belt conveyors, jaw crushers, vibrating screens, and complete crushing plants
          to clients across India. Our products are built to last and priced to deliver real value.
        </p>
        <div class="about__features">
          <div class="about__feature">
            <i class="ri-checkbox-circle-fill"></i>
            <span>GST Registered Business</span>
          </div>
          <div class="about__feature">
            <i class="ri-checkbox-circle-fill"></i>
            <span>19+ Product Categories</span>
          </div>
          <div class="about__feature">
            <i class="ri-checkbox-circle-fill"></i>
            <span>Pan-India Client Base</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about__stats">
        <div class="about__stat-card">
          <span class="about__stat-num" data-count="10" data-suffix="+">0+</span>
          <span class="about__stat-label">Years in Business</span>
        </div>
        <div class="about__stat-card">
          <span class="about__stat-num" data-count="19" data-suffix="+">0+</span>
          <span class="about__stat-label">Products</span>
        </div>
        <div class="about__stat-card">
          <span class="about__stat-num" data-count="100" data-suffix="+">0+</span>
          <span class="about__stat-label">Happy Clients</span>
        </div>
        <div class="about__stat-card">
          <span class="about__stat-num" data-count="95" data-suffix="%">0%</span>
          <span class="about__stat-label">Response Rate</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--sp-10);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about__text {
    font-size: var(--fs-body);
    color: var(--body);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-3);
  }

  .about__text strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .about__features {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--sp-2);
    margin-top: var(--sp-4);
  }

  .about__feature {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: var(--fs-small);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .about__feature i {
    color: var(--success);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .about__stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--sp-4);
  }

  .about__stat-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: var(--sp-5) var(--sp-4);
    text-align: center;
    transition: transform var(--duration) var(--ease),
                box-shadow var(--duration) var(--ease);
  }

  .about__stat-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .about__stat-num {
    display: block;
    font-size: var(--fs-h1);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--accent);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-1);
  }

  .about__stat-label {
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .about__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--sp-6);
    }
  }
</style>
